    "text": "By Mike DeCourcy ,\n1 days ago The symbolism of Loyola team captain Jerry Harkness and Mississippi State captain Joe Dan Gold shaking hands at the center circle at Michigan State’s Jenison Fieldhouse in advance of their NCAA Tournament game in East Lansing, Mich., was powerful, but no photograph could fully capture the journey each traveled to meet on that night, in that moment. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
